Corpus / data note

The MIT license above covers the code in this repository (scoring scripts,
harness, and configuration).

The page scans in `images/` and the gold transcriptions in `txt/` are drawn from
the Library of Congress "By the People" (crowd.loc.gov) crowdsourced
transcription program. The underlying newspaper scans are Library of Congress
materials in the public domain, and the volunteer transcriptions are released by
the Library into the public domain (CC0). No additional copyright is asserted
over these files by this repository. Please credit the Library of Congress "By
the People" program when reusing the corpus.
